utting together an official  list of people who are missing right now  a lot of information is coming in and  out so they're trying to update that  list as soon as they cancel they can  actually focus on the people who are  really missing rather than the people  who just haven't been able to  communicate that they're okay maybe  they're at a shelter despite searching  for several hours yesterday guys  Chardonnay did not find her her father  out there on his property or any sort of  evidence of where he might be  Nora you really feel her pain and her  concern Maria thank you
 

